pe="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-fKMpaq gbKvZt pf-87_">The ultimate in strength.  Steel truss system with aluminum legs.  Extra head clearance. Wheelbases attach to footpads for easy maneuverability.<br></span></p></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="sc-tafSX ePbmtR pf-88_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px;position:relative" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-to-section="pf-4062b506" data-offset="{&quot;all&quot;:50,&quot;laptop&quot;:50,&quot;tablet&quot;:50,&quot;mobile&quot;:50}" href="#" data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-ggqHwD cfPuYX pf-89_"><a data-pf-type="Button" class="sc-cwHqhk faCeTo pf-90_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-fKMpaq gbKvZt pf-92_">REQUEST A QUOTE</span><i class="sc-fPrdjK imczZj pf-91_ pfa pfa-chevron-right" data-pf-type="Icon"></i></a></div></div></div></div></div><div data-section-id="pf-6463" data-pf-type="Section" class="sc-dISoPS dTAYdL pf-93_"><div style="--cw:1170px" class="sc-gFmZvT jHDdLx"><div class="sc-tafSX ePbmtR pf-94_ pf-r pf-c-cm" style="--s-xs:15px;position:relative" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-ggqHwD cfPuYX pf-95_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-kOHUsU fHbtje pf-96_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-fKMpaq gbKvZt pf-98_">WHAT MAKES US THE LEADER IN CUSTOM PRINTED CANOPIES?</span></h3></div></div></div><div class="sc-tafSX ePbmtR pf-99_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px;position:relative" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-ggqHwD cfPuYX pf-100_"><div data-pf-type="Divider" class="sc-eDPFhE jyqHSd pf-101_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-fKMpaq gbKvZt pf-103_">INDUSTRY LEADER</span></div></div></div></div><div class="sc-tafSX ePbmtR pf-104_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px;position:relative" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c