><h3 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-kOHUsU fHbtje pf-123_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-fKMpaq gbKvZt pf-125_">#1 Canopy Manufacturer in North America</span></h3><p class="sc-DWrEC ktnAfW pf-126_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-fKMpaq gbKvZt pf-128_">We are the industry leader in custom printed canopies.</span></p></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:3;--c-md:3;--c-lg:3"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-ggqHwD cfPuYX pf-129_"><div data-pf-type="Image" class="sc-ezrfit kknrKy pf-130_"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0260/9522/2843/t/3/assets/pf-f4271a48--unitedstates.png?v=1597851319" srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0260/9522/2843/t/3/assets/pf-f4271a48--unitedstates.png?v=1597851319 1536w" width="512" height="512"/></div><h3 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-kOHUsU fHbtje pf-131_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-fKMpaq gbKvZt pf-133_">Made in The<br>USA</span></h3><p class="sc-DWrEC ktnAfW pf-134_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-fKMpaq gbKvZt pf-136_">We print and manufacture in the USA.</span></p></div></div></div></div></div><div data-section-id="pf-ee21" data-pf-type="Section" class="sc-dISoPS dTAYdL pf-137_"><div style="--cw:1170px" class="sc-gFmZvT jHDdLx"><div class="sc-tafSX ePbmtR pf-138_ pf-r pf-c-cm" style="--s-xs:15px;position:relative" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-ggqHwD cfPuYX pf-139_"><div data-pf-type="Tabs" class="sc-kuVMvl gnxhvL pf-140_"><div data-pf-type="TabsMenu" class="sc-hyBbPk jmzaAC pf-141_"><button type="button" data-pf-tab-active="false" class="sc-dOvzpT gXVwTo pf-142_ pf-anchor" data-pf-type="TabHeader"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-fKMpaq gbKvZt pf-144_">DETAILS</span></button><button type="button" data-pf-tab-active="false" class="sc-dOvzpT gXVwTo pf-145_ pf-anchor" data-pf-type="TabHeader"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-fKMpaq gbKvZt pf-147_">SPECIFICATIONS</span></button><button type="button" data-pf-tab-active="true" class="sc-dOvzpT gXVwTo pf-148_ pf-anchor" data-pf-type="TabHeader"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-fKMpaq gbKvZt pf-150_">SUPPORT</span></button></div><div data-pf-type="TabContentWrapper" class="sc-gIEYZm aHipD pf-151_"><div data-pf-expandable="true" style="display:none" data-pf-type="TabsContent" class="sc-eSfNPg disFSQ pf-152_"><h2 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-kOHUsU fHbtje pf-153_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-fKMpaq gbKvZt pf-155_">Maximize your Visibility with an Impact Canopy</span></h2><p class="sc-DWrEC ktnAfW pf-156_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-fKMpaq gbKvZt pf-158_">How can you make every public appearance count? With custom and innovative canopies that make your presence known. Branded canopies capture the attention of those passing by, as well as foot traffic from far away, thanks to custom logo printing and color combinations. They deliver your message quickly and are the perfect way to promote your brand. Great for indoor and outdoor events including:</span></p><ul style="--text-indent:0;--line-spacing:10px" data-pf-type="List" class="sc-bStdFM cpknpT pf-159_"><li data-pf-type="List.Item" class="sc-iaJahb hYHOPs pf-160_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-fKMpaq gbKvZt pf-162_">Trade Show Displays</span></li><li data-pf-type="List.Item" class="sc-iaJahb hYHOPs pf-163_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-fKMpaq gbKvZt pf-165_">In-store promotions</span></li><li data-pf-type="List.Item" class="sc-iaJahb hYHOPs pf-166_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-fKMpaq gbKvZt pf-168_">Farmers Market</span></li><li data-pf-type="List.Item" class="sc-iaJahb hYHOPs pf-169_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-fKMpaq gbKvZt pf-171_">Festivals</span></li><li data-pf-type="List.Item" class="sc-iaJahb hYHOPs pf-172_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-fKMpaq gbKvZt pf-174_">Parties</span></li><li data-pf-type="List.Item" class="sc-iaJahb hYHOPs pf-175_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-fKMpaq gbKvZt pf-177_">Team sporting events<br></span></li><li data-pf-type="List.Item" class="sc-iaJahb hYHOPs pf-178_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-fKMpaq gbKvZt pf-180_">Corporate Events</span></li><li data-pf-type="List.Item" class="sc-iaJahb hYHOPs pf-181_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-fKMpaq gbKvZt pf-183_">Registration Booths</span></li><li data-pf-type="List.Item" class="sc-iaJahb hYHOPs pf-184_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-fKMpaq gbKvZt pf-186_">Demo Days</span></li></ul><p class="sc-DWrEC ktnAfW pf-187_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-fKMpaq gbKvZt pf-189_">The foundation of any good canopy is a frame. Not only are our frames strong, sturdy and durable, they’re also lightweight and easy to assemble. They’re the first thing you need to consider when picking the perfect canopy. The options for frames range by sizes and materials. You can learn more about our frames here.<br><br>Once you have decided on a frame, we can start getting creative with a top. Impact’s Instant Canopies are equipped with a premium 500 denier polyester top that is water, mildew and rot resistant and meets ULCS 109, CPAI 84 and NFPA 701 Fire codes. The great thing about custom printed canopies is that they are specifically designed with your needs in mind. Digitally printed products from Impact Canopy can be matched to virtually any Pantone solid-coated color. No matter what color you use in your branding, Impact Canopy will be able to match it – or find a close alternative with more cost-effective choices depending on your needs.<br></span></p></div><div data-pf-expandable="true" style="display:none" data-pf-type="TabsContent" class="sc-eSfNPg disFSQ pf-190_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-kOHUsU fHbtje pf-191_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-fKMpaq gbKvZt pf-193_">Canopy Specifications</span></h3><p class="sc-DWrEC ktnAfW pf-194_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-fKMpaq gbKvZt pf-196_">Impact canopy offers a variety of frames to fit every need. Not sure which frame is right for you? Contact us and we will be happy to assist you in getting the perfect canopy! Here are some more details on our most popular frames:<br><br>DS Steel Frame: This frame is a lightweight powder coated steel frame with plastic fittings. The foot pads are nylon fiberglass that are reinforced with steel. The DS Frame is also available in black and it comes in sizes 5′ x 5′, 8′ x 8′, 8′ x 12′, and 10′ x 10′. See the DS Frame specs here.<br><br>CL Steel frame: This Frame is our heavy duty industrial steel frame with nylon fittings and steel foot pads. The CL Frame is also available in black and it comes in sizes 10′ x 10′, 10′ x 15′, and 10′ x 20′. See the CL Frame specs here.<br><br>10×10 ML Aluminum Frame: This frame is our lightest frame made with industrial aluminum. It includes reinforced cross bars, double sided brackets and is rust resistant. It comes in sizes 10′ x 10′, 10′ x 15′, and 10′ x 20′. See the ML Frame specs here.<br><br>10×10 M Aluminum Frame: This frame is our heavy duty, aircraft grade aluminum frame. It includes similar features to our ML frame, but is thicker making it one of our most durable frames. It comes in sizes 10′ x 10′, 10′ x 15′, and 10′ x 20‘. See the M Frame specs here.<br><br>MegaX Aluminum Frame: This frame is our most durable commercial grade aluminum frame. With an anodized aluminum brush finish and and nylon fiberglass connectors, it is unmatched in the instant canopy industry. The MegaX offers a wide variety of sizes including 10′ x 10′, 13′ x 20′, 13′ x 26′, 16′ x 16′, and 20′ x 20′. See the MegaX specs here.<br><br>All of our tops are Water Repellent &amp; UV Coated and meet ULC-S109, CPAI-84 and NFPA 701 Fire Resistant Requirements.<br></span></p></div><div data-pf-expandable="true" style="display:block" data-pf-type="TabsContent" class="sc-eSfNPg disFSQ pf-197_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-kOHUsU fHbtje pf-198_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-fKMpaq gbKvZt pf-200_">Canopy Support</span></h3><p class="sc-DWrEC ktnAfW pf-201_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-fKMpaq gbKvZt pf-203_">If you require additional support, please fill out this form and a Customer Service Representative will get in touch with you. If you need immediate support, please call US: 877.840.3524 | Canada: 877.776.6655</span></p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-section-id="pf-41f0" data-pf-type="Section" class="sc-dISoPS dTAYdL pf-204_"><div class="sc-gFmZvT jHDdLx"><div class="sc-tafSX ePbmtR pf-205_ pf-r pf-c-cm" style="--s-xs:15px;position:relative" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-ggqHwD cfPuYX pf-206_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-kOHUsU fHbtje pf-207_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-fKMpaq gbKvZt pf-209_">INDUSTRY LEADERS TRUST IMPACT CANOPY</span></h3></div></div></div><div class="sc-tafSX ePbmtR pf-210_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px;position:relative" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-ggqHwD cfPuYX pf-211_"><div data-pf-type="Divider" class="sc-eDPFhE jyqHSd pf-212_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-fKMpaq gbKvZt pf-214_">BRANDS THAT TRUST US</span></div></div></div></div><div class="sc-tafSX ePbmtR pf-215_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px;position:relative" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-ggqHwD cfPuYX pf-216_"><div data-slider="{'slidesToShow':{'all':7,'laptop':3,'tablet':2,'mobile':1},'slidesToScroll':{'all':1,'laptop':1,'tablet':1,'mobile':1},'loop':false,'autoPlay':true,'autoPlayDelay':1626,'pauseOnHover':false,'id':'8d6abdf4-b03b-457d-b12c-af16e5accd1e'}" class="sc-fIGKkh eqAWGF pf-217_" style="visibili